  "en": "It's not a lot, but it's enough to get you started.",
  "start": 113.56,
  "end": 115.0
 },
 {
  "en": "Oh, no, no, I can't take this.",
  "start": 115.21,
  "end": 116.49
 },
 {
  "en": "I did this because I wanted to help you guys.",
  "start": 116.5,
  "end": 118.35
 },
 {
  "en": "Hey, buy a car, get a bus ticket, do whatever, just get out of here.",
