  "end": 142.32
 },
 {
  "en": "I mean, what if something goes wrong and she gets hurt?",
  "start": 142.33,
  "end": 145.3
 },
 {
  "en": "I need some incentive just in case Whistler doesn't want to go quietly.",
  "start": 143.81,
  "end": 146.98
 },
 {
  "en": "You think any of this is going to go down quiet?",
  "start": 147.34,
  "end": 149.24
 },
 {
  "en": "They're just going to give you LJ just like that?",
