  "end": 152.47
 },
 {
  "en": "Doesn't matter what I think.",
  "start": 150.55,
  "end": 152.47
 },
 {
  "en": "I know what these people are capable of.",
  "start": 152.48,
  "end": 154.01
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm not going to gamble with my son's life.",
  "start": 154.3,
  "end": 155.61
 },
 {
  "en": "Maybe you don't have to.",
  "start": 158.29,
  "end": 159.1
 },
 {
  "en": "Alex.",
