  "en": "They need to know everything.",
  "start": 193.15,
  "end": 194.28
 },
 {
  "en": "About the President, about the company.",
  "start": 195.34,
  "end": 197.55
 },
 {
  "en": "They want to confirm that you have viable incriminating information and that you can be a cooperative witness.",
  "start": 197.71,
  "end": 202.72
 },
 {
  "en": "If I cooperate fully...",
  "start": 203.59,
  "end": 204.64
 },
 {
  "en": "I won't just be incriminating them.",
  "start": 208.84,
  "end": 210.37
 },
 {
  "en": "You're worried about all those skeletons in your closet, but you have full immunity.",
