  "end": 254.09
 },
 {
  "en": "Then what the hell was all that about?!",
  "start": 254.38,
  "end": 255.52
 },
 {
  "en": "You want to make it out of here without being seen, you need a diversion. Now we have one.",
  "start": 255.53,
  "end": 259.8
 },
 {
  "en": "You're off your head. Do you know that? They're waiting...",
  "start": 260.14,
  "end": 261.7
 },
 {
  "en": "We don't have time for this. It's almost 3:00, and that means the tower guard should be drugged by now.",
  "start": 261.71,
  "end": 265.68
 },
 {
  "en": "At 3:13, the sun's going to hit the other guard tower.",
  "start": 266.07,
  "end": 268.28
 },
 {
  "en": "We'll have the cover we need. It's now or never.",
  "start": 268.62,
  "end": 270.7
 },
 {
  "en": "Listen, Michael, I, uh...",
  "start": 272.97,
  "end": 274.15
 },
 {
  "en": "I meant what I said about Sara.",
  "start": 275.81,
  "end": 278.02
 },
 {
  "en": "If I were you I wouldn't mention that name again.",
  "start": 278.27,
  "end": 279.9
 },
 {
  "en": "We're getting out of here now, and then I'm trading you for my nephew.",
  "start": 280.38,
  "end": 282.99
 },
 {
  "en": "And then I'm going to find out who's responsible for taking her life...",
  "start": 283.12,
  "end": 285.79
 },
 {
  "en": "And I'm taking theirs.",
  "start": 287.12,
  "end": 288.1
 },
 {
