 {
  "en": "Let's go.",
  "start": 1070.6,
  "end": 1071.3
 },
 {
  "en": "Fight! Fight! Fight! Fight! Fight! Fight!",
  "start": 1093.6,
  "end": 1097.6
 },
 {
  "en": "What are you gentlemen waiting for?",
  "start": 1117.8,
  "end": 1119.2
 },
 {
  "en": "You two don't make this more interesting, I will.",
  "start": 1125.2,
  "end": 1127.2
 },
 {
  "en": "Sorry, mate- if only one of us is getting out...",
  "start": 1133.7,
  "end": 1135.7
 },
 {
  "en": "How's it look?",
  "start": 1153.0,
  "end": 1153.8
 },
 {
  "en": "They got LJ in the back of the van.",
  "start": 1154.3,
  "end": 1155.5
 },
 {
  "en": "He seem all right to you?",
  "start": 1156.1,
  "end": 1157.6
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah, I think so.",
  "start": 1156.1,
  "end": 1157.6
 },
 {
  "en": "All right, how many people they got?",
  "start": 1158.8,
  "end": 1159.8
 },
 {
  "en": "She's got a driver and a bodyguard- that's it.",
  "start": 1160.1,
  "end": 1162.0
 },
 {
  "en": "All right. You know I appreciate you hanging around, man",
  "start": 1162.2,
  "end": 1164.9
 },
 {
  "en": "Hey, we started this together, bro.",
  "start": 1165.1,
  "end": 1166.8
 },
 {
  "en": "Let's finish it that way.",
  "start": 1167.4,
  "end": 1168.4
 },
 {
  "en": "Come on, Michael.",
  "start": 1171.1,
  "end": 1171.7
 },
 {
  "en": "Where are you?",
  "start": 1172.8,
  "end": 1173.6
 },
 {
  "en": "What you doing here?",
  "start": 1237.0,
  "end": 1237.5
 },
 {
  "en": "You're supposed to be keeping watch.",
  "start": 1237.6,
  "end": 1238.6
 },
 {
  "en": "Just checking, making sure everything is all right.",
  "start": 1239.0,
  "end": 1241.3
 },
 {
  "en": "They're running a bit late, that's all.",
  "start": 1242.5,
  "end": 1243.7
 },
 {
  "en": "So, what's the plan?",
  "start": 1245.0,
  "end": 1245.9
 },
 {
  "en": "You gonna swim out, wait for the police to pass, and...",
  "start": 1247.5,
  "end": 1250.9
 },
 {
  "en": "Meet with a boat somewhere?",
  "start": 1251.6,
  "end": 1252.7
 },
 {
  "en": "Something like that.",
  "start": 1253.9,
  "end": 1254.6
 },
 {
  "en": "And then what?",
  "start": 1257.3,
  "end": 1258.1
 },
 {
  "en": "You know what, you need to get back to the car...",
  "start": 1258.6,
  "end": 1261.2
 },
 {
  "en": "Don't move.",
  "start": 1260.1,
  "end": 1261.2
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm impressed.",
  "start": 1267.1,
  "end": 1267.9
 },
 {
  "en": "You've actually got the guts to look me in the eye as you stab me in the back.",
  "start": 1268.3,
  "end": 1270.5
 },
 {
  "en": "What are you going to do, shoot me?",
  "start": 1271.3,
  "end": 1273.1
 },
 {
  "en": "Don't. I can't let you hand over",
  "start": 1273.13,
  "end": 1274.9
 },
 {
  "en": "James to those people.",
  "start": 1275.0,
  "end": 1275.8
 },
 {
  "en": "You need to think about what you're doing.",
  "start": 1276.0,
  "end": 1277.0
 },
 {
  "en": "I have!",
  "start": 1277.1,
  "end": 1277.9
 },
 {
  "en": "Every since you told me what they did to Sara.",
  "start": 1278.5,
  "end": 1280.4
 },
 {
  "en": "When they get here, James and I, we're leaving.",
  "start": 1281.4,
  "end": 1283.8
 },
 {
  "en": "Where to?",
  "start": 1285.2,
  "end": 1285.9
 },
 {
  "en": "I don't know. Somewhere they won't find us.",
  "start": 1286.2,
  "end": 1288.5
 },
 {
  "en": "So, this whole time, you played me.",
  "start": 1289.9,
  "end": 1291.1
 },
 {
  "en": "Like you've been playing me.",
  "start": 1291.3,
  "end": 1292.6
 },
 {
  "en": "Bringing me here to be your lookout?",
  "start": 1292.7,
  "end": 1294.2
 },
 {
  "en": "But it's okay.",
  "start": 1296.0,
  "end": 1296.8
 },
 {
  "en": "We were both here doing what we had to for the people we love.",
  "start": 1297.9,
  "end": 1300.3
 },
 {
  "en": "You do this, you may as well be shooting my son yourself.",
  "start": 1303.7,
  "end": 1306.2
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm sorry.",
  "start": 1312.7,
  "end": 1313.4
 },
 {
  "en": "They should be out by now. Any sign?",
  "start": 1330.1,
  "end": 1331.9
 },
 {
  "en": "All quiet.",
  "start": 1332.0,
  "end": 1332.6
 },
 {
  "en": "How much longer do you want to give them?",
  "start": 1333.1,
  "end": 1334.1
 },
 {
  "en": "I know you wanted to live by an ocean your whole life.",
  "start": 1338.6,
  "end": 1340.3
 },
 {
  "en": "Sad to think the closest you'll get is being buried under one.",
  "start": 1340.9,
  "end": 1343.29
 },
 {
  "en": "You're not gonna kill me.",
  "start": 1343.32,
  "end": 1344.42
 },
 {
  "en": "Oh?",
  "start": 1344.7,
  "end": 1346.0
 },
 {
  "en": "You need me.",
  "start": 1344.7,
  "end": 1346.0
 },
 {
  "en": "You already killed Sara.",
  "start": 1346.2,
  "end": 1347.25
 },
 {
  "en": "Anything happens to me, you're out of bargaining chips.",
  "start": 1347.3,
  "end": 1351.07
 },
 {
  "en": "If Michael doesn't get Whistler out today, I won't need to bargain anymore.",
  "start": 1351.1,
  "end": 1354.6
 },
 {
  "en": "You'll all be dead.",
  "start": 1355.4,
  "end": 1356.2
 },
 {
  "en": "Hurtdo?",
  "start": 1378.1,
  "end": 1378.8
 },
 {
  "en": "Kick him in the junk, Scofield!",
  "start": 1412.1,
  "end": 1413.4
 },
 {
  "en": "What are you looking for, boy! There are no draws here!",
  "start": 1421.8,
  "end": 1424.3
 },
 {
  "en": "If this isn't finished by one of you, I'm coming down to finish both of you.",
  "start": 1424.7,
  "end": 1427.6
 },
 {
  "en": "Hurtdo?",
  "start": 1434.5,
  "end": 1435.8
 },
 {
  "en": "End it.",
  "start": 1474.49,
  "end": 1475.49
 },
 {
  "en": "God! God forgive me.",
  "start": 1481.4,
  "end": 1483.4
 },
 {
  "en": "They should have been here by now.",
  "start": 1511.6,
  "end": 1512.5
 },
 {
  "en": "Maybe they get out. They should be on their way.",
  "start": 1512.6,
  "end": 1514.1
 },
 {
  "en": "They didn't make it.",
  "start": 1515.2,
  "end": 1517.5
 },
 {
  "en": "So what do we do now?",
  "start": 1515.2,
  "end": 1517.5
 },
 {
  "en": "I don't care what you do, but I'm taking the car.",
  "start": 1517.9,
  "end": 1519.4
 },
 {
  "en": "What?",
  "start": 1520.4,
  "end": 1520.7
 },
 {
  "en": "What the hell's going on?",
  "start": 1578.9,
  "end": 1580.0
 },
 {
  "en": "Put your hands up on your head!",
  "start": 1583.7,
  "end": 1584.6
 },
 {
  "en": "You come down here.",
  "start": 1594.0,
  "end": 1596.1
 },
 {
  "en": "Now!",
  "start": 1597.5,
  "end": 1597.6
 },
 {
  "en": "We are going to find out who is behind this.",
  "start": 1599.2,
  "end": 1601.7
 },
 {
  "en": "What?",
  "start": 1609.8,
  "end": 1610.5
 },
 {
  "en": "Were you going to let me know what the hell's going on?",
  "start": 1611.1,
  "end": 1612.6
 },
 {
  "en": "Lincoln?",
  "start": 1615.0,
  "end": 1615.4
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm here.",
  "start": 1616.1,
  "end": 1616.3
 },
 {
  "en": "Good. Where are they?",
  "start": 1616.9,
  "end": 1617.8
 },
 {
  "en": "They're in the car with me.",
  "start": 1621.5,
  "end": 1622.3
 },
 {
  "en": "I heard the alarm.",
  "start": 1622.9,
  "end": 1623.6
 },
 {
  "en": "They were long gone before that thing went off.",
  "start": 1623.7,
  "end": 1625.6
 },
 {
  "en": "Well, if they had such a head start, why are you so far behind?",
  "start": 1626.0,
  "end": 1628.4
 },
 {
  "en": "Listen, do you want me to talk to your drive?",
  "start": 1628.7,
  "end": 1630.7
 },
 {
  "en": "I want you to put Whistler on the phone.",
  "start": 1631.0,
  "end": 1632.9
 },
 {
  "en": "What?",
  "start": 1633.7,
  "end": 1634.1
 },
 {
  "en": "Put him on.",
  "start": 1634.7,
  "end": 1637.2
 },
 {
  "en": "He's in the trunk.",
  "start": 1638.0,
  "end": 1638.9
 },
 {
  "en": "But, if you feel that strongly about it, I can pull over and you two can have a nice little talk.",
  "start": 1639.2,
  "end": 1642.9
 },
 {
  "en": "If we're real lucky, maybe some cops will swing by.",
  "start": 1643.0,
  "end": 1645.0
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm sure they'd like a word, too.",
  "start": 1645.1,
  "end": 1646.1
 },
 {
  "en": "You know what? Just get LJ ready.",
  "start": 1646.3,
  "end": 1649.1
 },
 {
  "en": "Whoever tried to escape assaulted one of my men.",
  "start": 1654.4,
  "end": 1658.3
 },
 {
  "en": "And, as you know, any attempt on the life of a Panamanian soldier",
  "start": 1660.0,
  "end": 1664.6
 },
 {
  "en": "Warrants the death penalty.",
  "start": 1666.3,
  "end": 1667.9
 },
 {
  "en": "This attempt was made from cell #212.",
  "start": 1668.7,
  "end": 1670.8
 },
 {
  "en": "And if memory serves, that cell belongs to members of your crew, no?",
  "start": 1671.4,
  "end": 1676.9
 },
 {
  "en": "You.",
  "start": 1692.7,
  "end": 1693.2
 },
 {
  "en": "You are one of the Milkman's boys.",
  "start": 1697.7,
  "end": 1699.0
 },
 {
  "en": "Is it your cell?",
  "start": 1701.6,
  "end": 1702.2
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm going to take that as a \"Yes\".",
  "start": 1723.2,
  "end": 1725.1
 },
 {
  "en": "I thought we were compadres, you and I.",
  "start": 1729.3,
  "end": 1732.2
 },
 {
  "en": "I let you run your business, have your whores.",
  "start": 1732.7,
  "end": 1735.0
 },
 {
  "en": "When you asked me for your own personal supply of water when the plumbing went down, did I not provide it?",
  "start": 1735.4,
  "end": 1740.1
 },
 {
  "en": "When you asked me to get rid of the phones, make them contraband, so you could control the trade in here, did I not comply?",
  "start": 1740.6,
  "end": 1747.8
 },
 {
  "en": "I do all this for you.",
  "start": 1749.5,
  "end": 1750.3
 },
 {
  "en": "And in exchange, you were to do one thing for me.",
  "start": 1750.9,
  "end": 1754.6
 },
 {
  "en": "Keep these men in line!",
  "start": 1756.5,
  "end": 1758.9
 },
 {
  "en": "Maybe we just backed the wrong horse.",
  "start": 1768.0,
  "end": 1769.7
 },
 {
  "en": "Perhaps there is another in here better suited for the job.",
  "start": 1771.2,
  "end": 1775.5
 },
 {
  "en": "Good luck, Bredda.",
  "start": 1786.0,
  "end": 1788.8
 },
 {
  "en": "You know none of us tried to break out of that cell.",
  "start": 1811.4,
  "end": 1813.8
 },
 {
  "en": "I do.",
  "start": 1815.0,
  "end": 1815.2
 },
 {
  "en": "Then you must know there's only one guy here foolish enough to try.",
  "start": 1816.2,
  "end": 1819.3
 },
 {
  "en": "Nice to see you back in form.",
  "start": 1833.9,
  "end": 1835.1
 },
 {
  "en": "Thanks.",
  "start": 1836.2,
  "end": 1836.5
 },
 {
  "en": "Any news from Sullins?",
  "start": 1837.7,
  "end": 1838.7
 },
 {
  "en": "He's working on it.",
  "start": 1839.3,
  "end": 1839.9
 },
 {
  "en": "It doesn't matter what people say.",
  "start": 1845.3,
  "end": 1846.5
 },
 {
  "en": "What do they say?",
  "start": 1848.3,
  "end": 1848.9
 },
 {
  "en": "You know people, how they talk. About?",
  "start": 1849.6,
  "end": 1852.8
 },
 {
  "en": "The men, the ones they say you killed.",
  "start": 1853.5,
  "end": 1855.4
 },
 {
  "en": "Is it true?",
  "start": 1857.5,
  "end": 1857.8
 },
 {
  "en": "Because, if it is, you can talk to about it.",
  "start": 1860.4,
  "end": 1862.2
 },
 {
  "en": "Is that a fact?",
  "start": 1874.0,
  "end": 1874.9
 },
 {
  "en": "Yes. You can trust me.",
  "start": 1876.5,
  "end": 1877.8
 },
 {
  "en": "So let me get this straight.",
  "start": 1877.9,
  "end": 1878.8
 },
 {
  "en": "Sullins sends you to be good cop?",
  "start": 1878.9,
  "end": 1880.2
 },
 {
  "en": "That's not what this is.",
  "start": 1881.7,
  "end": 1882.4
 },
 {
  "en": "There never was a deal, was there?",
  "start": 1882.6,
  "end": 1884.0
 },
 {
  "en": "Sullins just wants me to confess so he can bring me up on more charges back in the States.",
  "start": 1884.2,
  "end": 1888.1
 },
 {
  "en": "The deal is legit.",
  "start": 1888.2,
  "end": 1889.2
 },
 {
  "en": "The hearing was supposed to be an hour after we left the prison, and I'm still waiting.",
  "start": 1889.3,
  "end": 1893.7
 },
 {
  "en": "So why don't you just come clean, Felicia, huh?",
  "start": 1894.1,
  "end": 1895.9
 },
 {
  "en": "For old times' sake? How about it?",
  "start": 1896.1,
  "end": 1897.6
 },
 {
  "en": "How about you do me the same courtesy, Alex?",
  "start": 1900.4,
  "end": 1902.3
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm not blind. My brother was a user.",
  "start": 1903.2,
  "end": 1905.1
 },
 {
  "en": "I can smell the stuff a mile away.",
  "start": 1905.3,
  "end": 1906.3
 },
 {
  "en": "Don't you accuse me of being the one who's hiding something.",
  "start": 1906.8,
  "end": 1909.9
 },
 {
  "en": "Hey, I just got confirmation from the radio.",
  "start": 1924.2,
  "end": 1925.7
 },
 {
  "en": "The guards took a head count and they secured the perimeter.",
  "start": 1926.3,
  "end": 1928.3
 },
 {
  "en": "No one made it out of there today.",
  "start": 1928.7,
  "end": 1930.5
 },
 {
  "en": "Sucre, what's going on?",
  "start": 1933.8,
  "end": 1934.6
 },
 {
  "en": "Looks like they're packing up.",
  "start": 1936.2,
  "end": 1936.9
 },
 {
  "en": "Whatever you do don't let them take LJ, all right?",
  "start": 1937.3,
  "end": 1939.4
 },
 {
  "en": "Linc? Linc?",
  "start": 1940.6,
  "end": 1942.4
 },
 {
  "en": "Sucre?",
  "start": 1942.9,
  "end": 1943.2
 },
 {
  "en": "Get the hell out of here now.",
  "start": 1951.8,
  "end": 1952.9
 },
 {
  "en": "Look out!",
  "start": 1981.6,
  "end": 1982.2
 },
 {
  "en": "Dad!",
  "start": 2034.5,
  "end": 2034.8
 },
 {
  "en": "Let her go",
  "start": 2034.9,
  "end": 2035.5
 },
 {
  "en": "Drop it or I swear to God I'll put a bullet in her head!",
  "start": 2037.5,
  "end": 2039.5
 },
 {
  "en": "Now you let him go! You let him go now! Dad!",
  "start": 2039.6,
  "end": 2042.2
 },
 {
  "en": "LJ, I'm going to get you out of this, I promise.",
  "start": 2044.0,
  "end": 2046.1
 },
 {
  "en": "You sure you want to make promises to your son you can't keep?",
  "start": 2046.6,
  "end": 2048.9
 },
 {
  "en": "Watch your mouth.",
  "start": 2049.1,
  "end": 2049.8
 },
 {
  "en": "I'll let you in on a little secret.",
  "start": 2050.0,
  "end": 2051.2
 },
 {
  "en": "When you choose this line of work, you know it's all going to come down to a moment like this.",
  "start": 2052.6,
  "end": 2056.4
 },
 {
  "en": "So kill me.",
  "start": 2058.5,
  "end": 2059.3
 },
 {
  "en": "Let him go.",
  "start": 2064.0,
  "end": 2064.2
 },
 {
  "en": "Let him go!",
  "start": 2067.6,
  "end": 2068.7
 },
 {
  "en": "Kill him.",
  "start": 2067.6,
  "end": 2068.7
 },
 {
  "en": "Kill him.",
  "start": 2069.1,
  "end": 2069.5
 },
 {
  "en": "Dad!",
  "start": 2069.8,
  "end": 2070.0
 },
 {
  "en": "It doesn't matter what you do to me.",
  "start": 2071.4,
  "end": 2072.6
 },
 {
  "en": "The operation failed.",
  "start": 2073.2,
  "end": 2074.5
 },
 {
  "en": "So put your gun down, Linc.",
  "start": 2075.2,
  "end": 2077.1
 },
 {
  "en": "Kill him.",
  "start": 2080.3,
  "end": 2080.8
 },
 {
  "en": "Dad!",
  "start": 2081.2,
  "end": 2081.5
 },
 {
  "en": "No!",
  "start": 2084.7,
  "end": 2085.7
 },
 {
  "en": "No",
  "start": 2087.1,
  "end": 2087.7
 },
 {
  "en": "Give me one more shot.",
  "start": 2093.1,
  "end": 2094.0
 },
 {
  "en": "To do what?",
  "start": 2094.03,
  "end": 2094.9
 },
 {
  "en": "Let me find out what happened in Sona.",
  "start": 2095.6,
  "end": 2096.8
 },
 {
  "en": "Let me talk to Michael.",
  "start": 2096.84,
  "end": 2097.6
 },
 {
  "en": "We can still get Whistler.",
  "start": 2098.9,
  "end": 2099.8
 },
 {
  "en": "We can make this happen.",
  "start": 2100.3,
  "end": 2101.1
 },
 {
  "en": "We can make this happen. We...",
  "start": 2101.9,
  "end": 2102.9
 },
 {
  "en": "We can do this.",
  "start": 2110.2,
  "end": 2110.7
 },
 {
  "en": "Put him in the van.",
  "start": 2111.8,
  "end": 2112.8
 },
 {
  "en": "Sucre!",
  "start": 2137.3,
  "end": 2138.0
 },
 {
  "en": "You all right?",
  "start": 2139.7,
  "end": 2139.9
 },
 {
  "en": "What happened?",
  "start": 2140.4,
  "end": 2140.8
 },
 {
  "en": "Body bags.",
  "start": 2146.9,
  "end": 2147.5
 },
 {
  "en": "Look, what happened out there...",
  "start": 2161.3,
  "end": 2162.85
 },
 {
  "en": "Happened out there. It's over.",
  "start": 2162.89,
  "end": 2164.4
 },
 {
  "en": "All right then.",
  "start": 2165.8,
  "end": 2166.1
 },
 {
  "en": "Right, just so you know, I wouldn't have gone through with it.",
  "start": 2169.9,
  "end": 2173.47
 },
 {
  "en": "Lucky for us, we'll never have to find out.",
  "start": 2173.5,
  "end": 2175.4
 },
 {
  "en": "So what do we do now?",
  "start": 2177.6,
  "end": 2178.6
 },
 {
  "en": "You know where are you, boy?",
  "start": 2182.5,
  "end": 2183.6
 },
 {
  "en": "Well, I'm no doctor, You but I'm just guessing, boy.",
  "start": 2184.7,
  "end": 2186.36
 },
 {
  "en": "Your mother had a little bit too much to drink one night",
  "start": 2186.4,
  "end": 2188.5
 },
 {
  "en": "Keep talking and you're going to be next.",
  "start": 2189.7,
  "end": 2191.9
 },
 {
  "en": "How you want it, brother?",
  "start": 2209.4,
  "end": 2210.3
 },
 {
  "en": "Fast or slow?",
  "start": 2211.3,
  "end": 2212.9
 },
 {
  "en": "Think I like to handle this one myself.",
  "start": 2213.9,
  "end": 2217.0
 },
 {
  "en": "Do you have children, Mr. Scofield?",
  "start": 2230.0,
  "end": 2231.3
 },
 {
  "en": "Maybe someday.",
  "start": 2233.6,
  "end": 2234.4
 },
 {
  "en": "That's very optimistic for a man in your position.",
  "start": 2235.4,
  "end": 2237.2
 },
 {
  "en": "Myself, I have five.",
  "start": 2238.1,
  "end": 2239.1
 },
 {
  "en": "Three boys, two girls.",
  "start": 2240.0,
  "end": 2241.1
 },
 {
  "en": "Now I used to tell them a story",
  "start": 2242.0,
  "end": 2243.8
 },
 {
  "en": "I believe in your country they call it, \"The Boy Who Cried Wolf. \"",
  "start": 2244.3,
  "end": 2247.3
 },
 {
  "en": "You know it?",
  "start": 2247.9,
  "end": 2248.4
 },
 {
  "en": "Well, then you know the moral of that story is even when liars tell the truth, they can never be believed.",
  "start": 2249.1,
  "end": 2254.2
 },
 {
  "en": "But your life's on the line, boy.",
  "start": 2255.2,
  "end": 2256.8
 },
 {
  "en": "Are you trying to break out of this prison, Mr. Scofield?",
  "start": 2259.1,
  "end": 2261.4
 },
 {
  "en": "No.",
  "start": 2264.5,
  "end": 2265.3
 },
 {
  "en": "Are you trying to break out of this prison?",
  "start": 2269.2,
  "end": 2270.9
 },
 {
  "en": "We both know that's not possible.",
  "start": 2270.93,
  "end": 2272.16
 },
 {
  "en": "Answer me! What do you want me to say?",
  "start": 2272.2,
  "end": 2273.57
 },
 {
  "en": "I want you to tell me the truth. I want to hear it.",
  "start": 2273.6,
  "end": 2275.7
 },
 {
  "en": "You want a reason to kill me.",
  "start": 2275.74,
  "end": 2277.2
 },
 {
  "en": "No, boy...",
  "start": 2275.74,
  "end": 2277.2
 },
 {
  "en": "I have good reason to kill you.",
  "start": 2278.5,
  "end": 2279.3
 },
 {
  "en": "Because of you, it's no longer possible for me to effectively govern this prison.",
  "start": 2280.1,
  "end": 2282.9
 },
 {
  "en": "Justified or not, the men no longer have faith in me.",
  "start": 2283.4,
  "end": 2285.5
 },
 {
  "en": "That leaves only one thing for me to do to guarantee my survival.",
  "start": 2286.4,
  "end": 2288.8
 },
 {
  "en": "You are breaking out of this prison, Mr. Scofield.",
  "start": 2302.5,
  "end": 2305.8
 },
 {
  "en": "And you're taking me with you.",
  "start": 2308.0,
  "end": 2309.3
 },
 {
  "en": "Well, I've got some good news and I've got some better news.",
  "start": 2334.3,
  "end": 2337.5
 },
 {
  "en": "Let's start with the good.",
  "start": 2339.1,
  "end": 2340.0
 },
 {
  "en": "Panamanians are back on board.",
  "start": 2341.1,
  "end": 2342.5
 },
 {
  "en": "And the better news?",
  "start": 2344.7,
  "end": 2345.4
 },
 {
  "en": "You're going to get to have a really nice sleep on that bed.",
  "start": 2346.2,
  "end": 2348.1
 },
 {
  "en": "I thought that I...",
  "start": 2349.8,
  "end": 2350.5
 },
 {
  "en": "After the hearing I was going to be on a plane back to the U. S.",
  "start": 2352.0,
  "end": 2354.4
 },
 {
  "en": "You said...",
  "start": 2354.43,
  "end": 2355.97
 },
 {
  "en": "I did, and you will be, but it's just too late to do the hearing now.",
  "start": 2356.0,
  "end": 2359.3
 },
 {
  "en": "We'll get to it first thing tomorrow.",
  "start": 2359.34,
  "end": 2360.9
 },
 {
  "en": "Tomorrow morning?",
  "start": 2361.3,
  "end": 2363.1
 },
 {
  "en": "Sounds about right.",
  "start": 2361.3,
  "end": 2363.1
 },
 {
  "en": "Please... is there something, is there anything that we can do to help speed things up?",
  "start": 2367.3,
  "end": 2371.8
 },
 {
  "en": "When a genie grants you a wish you don't really tell him to make it snappy.",
  "start": 2372.1,
  "end": 2375.4
 },
 {
  "en": "This hearing needs to happen today.",
  "start": 2375.43,
  "end": 2377.8
 },
 {
  "en": "The hearing needs... needs to happen right now!",
  "start": 2379.1,
  "end": 2381.9
 },
 {
  "en": "Listen to you.",
  "start": 2382.2,
  "end": 2382.6
 },
 {
  "en": "You know, you are unbelievable.",
  "start": 2383.4,
  "end": 2384.5
 },
 {
  "en": "I have dropped everything to come down here and drag your sorry ass out of that hellhole...",
  "start": 2384.53,
  "end": 2390.95
 },
 {
  "en": "You don't understand.",
  "start": 2389.2,
  "end": 2390.95
 },
 {
  "en": "I've made you a deal.",
  "start": 2390.99,
  "end": 2392.7
 },
 {
  "en": "I can't... I can't wait.",
  "start": 2390.99,
  "end": 2392.7
 },
 {
  "en": "I can't wait.",
  "start": 2395.7,
  "end": 2396.3
 },
 {
  "en": "You know, I am so glad",
  "start": 2397.1,
  "end": 2398.5
 },
 {
  "en": "I have made this trip to help your esteemed colleague.",
  "start": 2398.53,
  "end": 2402.2
 },
 {
  "en": "I am just tickled.",
  "start": 2402.24,
  "end": 2403.1
 },
 {
  "en": "Cuff him.",
  "start": 2405.0,
  "end": 2405.3
 },
 {
  "en": "Is that necessary?",
  "start": 2407.2,
  "end": 2407.8
 },
 {
  "en": "Cuff him.",
  "start": 2407.84,
  "end": 2409.0
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm sorry.",
  "start": 2416.7,
  "end": 2417.3
 },
 {
  "en": "I can't wait.",
  "start": 2419.5,
  "end": 2420.2
 },
 {
  "en": "Hey, have you seen Whistler?",
  "start": 2430.0,
  "end": 2431.7
 },
 {
  "en": "No.",
  "start": 2432.2,
  "end": 2432.8
 },
 {
  "en": "I spent my whole career trying to keep bad people behind bars.",
  "start": 2434.4,
  "end": 2437.5
 },
 {
  "en": "Like somehow by doing my job",
  "start": 2438.4,
  "end": 2439.86
 },
 {
  "en": "I was making the world a better place.",
  "start": 2439.9,
  "end": 2441.6
 },
 {
  "en": "And then...",
  "start": 2444.2,
  "end": 2444.8
 },
 {
  "en": "Then you hear about what happened to someone like Sara.",
  "start": 2445.2,
  "end": 2447.4
 },
 {
  "en": "Damn if it doesn't seem like there's more bad people out there than in here.",
  "start": 2449.3,
  "end": 2452.6
 },
 {
  "en": "I warned the brothers what would happen if they failed.",
  "start": 2459.2,
  "end": 2461.4
 },
 {
  "en": "If I give them more time now, I may as well hand them a condom and a cigarette to go with it.",
  "start": 2462.3,
  "end": 2466.1
 },
 {
  "en": "You know, I came all the way down here.",
  "start": 2468.6,
  "end": 2470.2
 },
 {
  "en": "The least you could do is offer me an opinion.",
  "start": 2470.7,
  "end": 2472.97
 },
 {
  "en": "I thought we agreed it was best for you to not come here.",
  "start": 2473.0,
  "end": 2475.4
 },
 {
  "en": "And I thought you needed to be out in seven days.",
  "start": 2476.0,
  "end": 2477.8
 },
 {
  "en": "I need to know how this delay is going to affect things.",
  "start": 2479.5,
  "end": 2481.5
 },
 {
  "en": "Well, it won't be comfortable, but it will be possible.",
  "start": 2483.3,
  "end": 2486.3
 },
 {
  "en": "Oh, well, thank you, James, but that doesn't exactly ravage me with confidence.",
  "start": 2486.8,
  "end": 2490.3
 },
 {
  "en": "And what would?",
  "start": 2490.8,
  "end": 2491.4
 },
 {
  "en": "Your ass on a plane.",
  "start": 2491.9,
  "end": 2492.8
 },
 {
  "en": "Four more days.",
  "start": 2493.4,
  "end": 2494.8
 },
 {
  "en": "If I'm out of here by then, I can still do it.",
  "start": 2495.8,
  "end": 2499.3
 },
 {
  "en": "Trust me. It'll be fine.",
  "start": 2502.4,
  "end": 2503.6
 },
 {
  "en": "I'll let the brothers know.",
  "start": 2505.3,
  "end": 2506.8
 },
 {
  "en": "Gretchen.",
  "start": 2512.8,
  "end": 2513.8
 },
 {
  "en": "About Sofia...",
  "start": 2515.3,
  "end": 2516.5
 },
 {
  "en": "She's fine.",
  "start": 2518.3,
  "end": 2519.99
 },
 {
  "en": "Burrows is taking real good care of her.",
  "start": 2520.1,
  "end": 2522.5
 },
 {
  "en": "Good luck, James.",
  "start": 2522.88,
  "end": 2524.73
 },
 {
  "en": "Prison Break Season 03 Episode 07 \"Vamonos\"",
  "start": 2532.8,
  "end": 2539.0
 }
]